  "notes": "Two-storey cream house (#e0d6bd) with orange terracotta hip roof (#bf5a33) and rooftop solar panels. Front facade has chunky timber-framed windows and shutters (#8a6a3f) and a brown timber lattice/pergola screen at the upper floor over a front terrace. Frontage is a decorative low wall of white panels embossed with diamond and fleur-de-lis motifs, an ornate grey wrought-iron fence with diamond pattern, and a green panelled pedestrian door beside an ornate metal vehicle gate; brick-paved forecourt. A large white municipal recycling cabinet (Hebrew text) stands at the kerb (prop pending). Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
